[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15960.79, "timestamp": "04:26:00", "text": "楽しいことじゃないよ、君が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15963.83, "timestamp": "04:26:03", "text": "彼女とかそういうのは感じない。のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15965.11, "timestamp": "04:26:05", "text": "オフロード走行をしているとしましょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15967.03, "timestamp": "04:26:07", "text": "今はこれです。もしあればいいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15968.95, "timestamp": "04:26:08", "text": "ジャンプもせず、手を振ることもしない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15972.79, "timestamp": "04:26:12", "text": "車？いいえ。現実味を感じないでしょう。その通り。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15975.67, "timestamp": "04:26:15", "text": "うん。何も聞こえず、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15979.75, "timestamp": "04:26:19", "text": "スロットルの音が「d」のような音です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15981.429, "timestamp": "04:26:21", "text": "うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15985.51, "timestamp": "04:26:25", "text": "もう少し刺激があってもいいはずだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15988.55, "timestamp": "04:26:28", "text": "運転してみるか、そうやってみて。スリル、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15991.429, "timestamp": "04:26:31", "text": "推測。うん。うん。うん。スリル。スリル。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15994.75, "timestamp": "04:26:34", "text": "それがその言葉だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16004.149, "timestamp": "04:26:44", "text": "それで、えっと、将来何か予定はありますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16007.75, "timestamp": "04:26:47", "text": "えーと、あなたがやりたかったように、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16009.91, "timestamp": "04:26:49", "text": "コミュニティとあなたのチャンネルと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16012.79, "timestamp": "04:26:52", "text": "コンテンツとかそういうもの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16015.67, "timestamp": "04:26:55", "text": "ええ、私はたくさんのことをしたいんです、たくさん"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16016.02, "timestamp": "04:26:56", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "everything that can kills me makes me feel alive time thingy"}, {"type": "s